    "text": "My No. : 4 - 3/1 (Appoinment\u2014Acquisitions) Hon. Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms has appointed the below named officer in terms of the provisions of the Land Acquisition Act, as an Acquiring Officer to function under the directives of the Divisional Secretary concerned for land acquisitions made for Phase III of the Central Expressway Project. Name of the Officer Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division Duration of appointment 1. Mrs. H. B.M.W.H. K. Abesinghe Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division from 24.01.2019 for a period of (Assistant Divisional Secretary, - Mawathagama Two years ahead. Mawathagama) W. H. KARUNARATHNE, Secretary, Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.",
